Added: `NinoSerializer.Serialize(value, stream)` / `SerializeAsync` and `NinoDeserializer.Deserialize<T>(stream)` (also `ref value`) / `DeserializeAsync<T>`, with boxed forms: the same bytes as the span APIs with no framing, through pooled buffers, a read taking the stream to its end; intercepted calls go straight to the generated formatter (async forms not in the netstandard2.0 build).
